    "type": "math",
    "question": "উৎপাদকে বিশ্লেষণ করুন: x³ + 6x²y + 11xy² + 6y³",
    "steps": [
      "x³ + 6x²y + 11xy² + 6y³ = x³ + 6x²y + 12xy² + 8y³ − xy² − 2y³",
      "= (x + 2y)³ − y²(x + 2y)",
      "= (x + 2y){(x+2y)² − y²}",
      "= (x+2y)(x+2y+y)(x+2y−y)",
      "= (x+2y)(x+3y)(x+y)"
    ],
    "answer": "(x+y)(x+2y)(x+3y)"
  },
